up/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="5c2f9ab8-039f-46df-bcb5-aec710204064" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="relative max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)] bg-token-message-surface rounded-3xl px-5 py-2.5"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">&lt;!-- Cerita 3: Membatik di Kampung Wisata --&gt;
&lt;div class="story-container" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2rem;"&gt;
    &lt;div class="story-image" style="flex: 1;"&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://img.freepik.com/free-vector/hand-drawn-ribbon-collection_23-2149077160.jpg" alt="Kain Batik" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);"&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class="story-text" style="flex: 1;"&gt;
        &lt;h3 style="color: var(--rme-orange); margin-bottom: 1rem;"&gt;Batik di Kampung Taman&lt;/h3&gt;
        &lt;p style="color: #555; line-height: 1.6;"&gt;Siti dari Kampung Taman memiliki kain mori sepanjang 1 meter untuk latihan membatik. Ia perlu membaginya untuk 3 motif: 1/3 meter untuk parang, 1/6 meter untuk kawung, dan sisanya untuk ceplok. Dengan menggunakan gawangan kayu, Siti mengukur panjang kain untuk setiap motif.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p style="color: var(--rme-dark); font-style: italic;"&gt;"Berapa meter kain yang tersisa untuk motif ceplok Siti?"&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
Tolong buatkan gambar beranimasi untuk mewakilkan cerita ini</div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" aria-selected="false" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M13.2929 4.29291C15.0641 2.