flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="1701c987-6194-4e45-94b4-7d912fcce321" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="relative max-w-[var(--user-chat-width,70%)] bg-token-message-surface rounded-3xl px-5 py-2.5"><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap">&lt;!-- Fase 2: Model of (Representasi Pecahan) --&gt;
 &lt;div id="sifat" class="tab-content"&gt;
            &lt;section class="about-section"&gt;
                &lt;h2 class="section-title"&gt;Fase 2: Model Representasi Pecahan&lt;/h2&gt;
        &lt;div class="about-content"&gt;
            &lt;div class="about-image"&gt;
                &lt;img src="https://i.ibb.co/7YfXZzT/number-line.png" 
                     alt="Ilustrasi Pecahan" 
                     style="border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);max-width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #eee;"&gt;
                &lt;div style="margin-top:1.5rem;text-align:center;"&gt;
                    &lt;button onclick="showFractionDemo()" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FF7D00, #FF9F1C);color:white;border:none;padding:0.7rem 1.5rem;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:500;transition:all 0.3s ease;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);"&gt;
                        &lt;i class="fas fa-play-circle" style="margin-right:8px;"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Lihat Demo Pecahan
                    &lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class="about-text"&gt;
                &lt;h2 style="color:#4a5568;font-weight:600;border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:0.5rem;"&gt;🔍 Membangun Model Visual Pecahan&lt;/h2&gt;
                &lt;div class="context-example" style="background:#f8fafc;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:12px;border-left:4px solid #FF7D00;margin-bottom:2rem;"&gt;
                    &lt;p style="font-style:italic;color:#4a5568;margin:0;font-size:1.05rem;"&gt;"Dari pembagian bakpia, takaran gudeg, hingga kain batik - mari kita wujudkan konsep pecahan dalam bentuk visual yang mudah dipahami!"&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;!-- Kasus 1: Bakpia Pathok --&gt;
                &lt;div style="margin:2rem 0;"&gt;
                    &lt;h3 style="color:#4a5568;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600;"&gt;
                        &lt;i class="fas fa-pie-chart" style="color:#FF7D00;font-size:1.2em;"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Kasus 1: Diagram Bakpia Mbah Surti
                    &lt;/h3&gt;
                    &lt;p style="color:#4a5568;"&gt;1 dus bakpia dibagi 4 tetangga → masing-masing &lt;span style="color:#FF7D00;font-weight:bold;"&gt;¼ bagian&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
                    
                    &lt;div style="background:#f8fafc;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:12px;margin-top:1rem;text-align:center;"&gt;
                        &lt;!-- Pie Chart --&gt;
                        &lt;div style="width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(
                            #FF7D00 0% 25%, 
                            #4CC9F0 25% 50%, 
                            #2EC4B6 50% 75%, 
                            #E71D36 75% 100%
                        );margin:0 auto;position:relative;"&gt;
                            &lt;div style="position:absolute;width:160px;height:160px;background:white;border-radius:50%;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:bold;color:#FF7D00;"&gt;
                                1 Dus = 4/4
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/div&gt;
                        
                        &lt;div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;"&gt;
                            &lt;div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;"&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:15px;height:15px;background:#FF7D00;border-radius:3px;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                                &lt;span&gt;1/4 untuk Pak Joko&lt;/span&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;"&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:15px;height:15px;background:#4CC9F0;border-radius:3px;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                                &lt;span&gt;1/4 untuk Bu Siti&lt;/span&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/div&gt;
                        
                        &lt;p style="color:#FF7D00;margin-top:1rem;"&gt;Jika 2 tetangga berbagi 1 bagian → masing-masing dapat &lt;span style="font-weight:bold;"&gt;½ dari ¼ = ⅛ dus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;!-- Kasus 2: Gudeg Mbah Juminah --&gt;
                &lt;div style="margin:2rem 0;"&gt;
                    &lt;h3 style="color:#4a5568;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600;"&gt;
                        &lt;i class="fas fa-balance-scale" style="color:#2EC4B6;font-size:1.2em;"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Kasus 2: Takaran Gudeg Spesial
                    &lt;/h3&gt;
                    &lt;p style="color:#4a5568;"&gt;Resep membutuhkan &lt;span style="color:#2EC4B6;font-weight:bold;"&gt;¾ kg gula&lt;/span&gt; dan &lt;span style="color:#2EC4B6;font-weight:bold;"&gt;½ sdt ketumbar&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
                    
                    &lt;div style="background:#f8fafc;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:12px;margin-top:1rem;"&gt;
                        &lt;!-- Balance Scale --&gt;
                        &lt;div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-end;height:120px;margin-bottom:1rem;"&gt;
                            &lt;!-- Left Side --&gt;
                            &lt;div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-right:2rem;"&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:80px;height:20px;background:#FF9F1C;border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:5px;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:60px;height:60px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom, #FF7D00, #FF9F1C);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:bold;"&gt;
                                    ¾ kg
                                &lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                            
                          &lt;!-- Scale --&gt;
&lt;div style="width:4px;height:100px;background:#4a5568;position:relative;"&gt;
    &lt;div style="position:absolute;top:50%;left:-15px;width:34px;height:4px;background:#4a5568;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- Right Side --&gt;
&lt;div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-left:2rem;"&gt;
    &lt;div style="width:60px;height:15px;background:#4CC9F0;border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:5px;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom, #4CC9F0, #2EC4B6);border-radius:50%;position:relative;"&gt;
        &lt;span style="position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -50%);color:white;font-weight:bold;"&gt;
            ½ sdt
        &lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
                        
                        &lt;div style="text-align:center;"&gt;
                            &lt;p style="color:#4a5568;"&gt;Untuk 3 kali resep → &lt;span style="color:#2EC4B6;font-weight:bold;"&gt;3 × ¾ = 2¼ kg gula&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;div style="display:inline-block;margin-top:0.5rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#FF7D00;color:white;border-radius:5px;font-weight:bold;"&gt;
                                ¾ + ¾ + ¾ = 2¼
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;!-- Kasus 3: Kain Batik Siti --&gt;
                &lt;div style="margin:2rem 0;"&gt;
                    &lt;h3 style="color:#4a5568;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600;"&gt;
                        &lt;i class="fas fa-ruler-combined" style="color:#E71D36;font-size:1.2em;"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Kasus 3: Pembagian Kain Batik
                    &lt;/h3&gt;
                    &lt;p style="color:#4a5568;"&gt;1 meter kain dibagi untuk 3 motif:&lt;/p&gt;
                    
                    &lt;div style="background:#f8fafc;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:12px;margin-top:1rem;"&gt;
                        &lt;!-- Fabric Visualization --&gt;
                        &lt;div style="height:80px;background:linear-gradient(to right, 
                            #FF7D00 0% 33.33%, 
                            #E71D36 33.33% 50%, 
                            #4CC9F0 50% 100%);position:relative;border-radius:5px;margin-bottom:1rem;"&gt;
                            
                            &lt;div style="position:absolute;left:33.33%;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:white;transform:translateX(-50%);"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;div style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:white;transform:translateX(-50%);"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                            
                            &lt;div style="position:absolute;left:16.66%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:white;padding:0.2rem 0.5rem;border-radius:3px;font-weight:bold;color:#FF7D00;"&gt;⅓m&lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;div style="position:absolute;left:41.66%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:white;padding:0.2rem 0.5rem;border-radius:3px;font-weight:bold;color:#E71D36;"&gt;⅙m&lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;div style="position:absolute;left:75%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:white;padding:0.2rem 0.5rem;border-radius:3px;font-weight:bold;color:#4CC9F0;"&gt;½m&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/div&gt;
                        
                        &lt;div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;text-align:center;"&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:#FF7D00;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:bold;"&gt;P&lt;/div&gt;
                                &lt;p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:#4a5568;"&gt;Parang&lt;br&gt;⅓ meter&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:#E71D36;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:bold;"&gt;K&lt;/div&gt;
                                &lt;p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:#4a5568;"&gt;Kawung&lt;br&gt;⅙ meter&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:#4CC9F0;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:bold;"&gt;C&lt;/div&gt;
                                &lt;p style="margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:#4a5568;"&gt;Ceplok&lt;br&gt;½ meter&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/div&gt;
                        
                        &lt;div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1rem;padding:0.8rem;background:#FF7D00;color:white;border-radius:5px;font-weight:bold;"&gt;
                            1 - (⅓ + ⅙) = ½ meter untuk ceplok
                        &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;

                &lt;div style="background:#fffaf0;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:12px;margin-top:2rem;border-left:4px solid #FF9F1C;"&gt;
                    &lt;h3 style="color:#DD6B20;margin-top:0;font-weight:600;"&gt;✂️ Aktivitas Pembelajaran Pecahan&lt;/h3&gt;
                    &lt;ul style="margin-left:1rem;color:#4a5568;padding-left:1rem;"&gt;
                        &lt;li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pizza Kertas&lt;/strong&gt;: Potong lingkaran kertas menjadi bagian pecahan dan susun kombinasi&lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gelas Bertingkat&lt;/strong&gt;: Ukur cairan berwarna dalam gelas transparan dengan skala pecahan&lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Puzzle Pecahan&lt;/strong&gt;: Susun potongan kain/kertas dengan ukuran pecahan berbeda membentuk persegi utuh&lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;/ul&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;script&gt;
function showFractionDemo() {
    alert("Demo interaktif pecahan akan muncul di sini!\n(Fitur dapat dikembangkan dengan drag-and-drop pecahan)");
}
&lt;/script&gt;
Tolong buatkan gambar beranimasi untuk mewakilkan cerita ini</div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-end"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex items-center p-1 select-none duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-selected="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" aria-selected="false" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-[38px] flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-md-heavy"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M13.2929 4.29291C15.0641 2.